# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout commits CRLF into files that other platforms read as
# data — and a script that arrived with CRLF fails on a Unix shell with a confusing
# "bad interpreter" error. Text is stored with LF; Windows scripts keep CRLF because
# cmd.exe is unhappy without it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets stay untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
